      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like there is no way to undo what happened. i see them all laughing together in the halls and i know i’m never gonna be part of that again. it’s like the version of me they knew is just gone. how am i supposed to just keep existing like this? it's exhausting pretending i'm even here.",
